  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:yisrael_nosha_badonai">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/45/17"/><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/1"/>Israel will be delivered by Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/2"/>for an everlasting deliverance;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/3"/>she will not be ashamed or humiliated
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/4"/>for all eternity.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/5"/>The hope of Israel is Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/6"/>their deliverer in time of affliction.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:jeremiah/17/13"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/7"/>Hope of Israel, Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/8"/>all who forsake You, will be humiliated.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:jeremiah/31/17"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/9"/>“And there is hope in your destiny
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/10"/>says Adonoy,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/11"/>“[Your] children will return to their borders.”
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/40/2"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/12"/>I hoped continually for Adonoy’s [help],
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/13"/>and He turned to me and heard my cry.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/14"/>Righteousness is Yours, my Master,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/15"/>and the shame is ours
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/16"/>to this very day.
<tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/51/20"/>
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/17"/>Do good, as You see fit, to Zion
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yisrael_nosha_badonai/18"/>may You rebuild the walls of Jerusalem.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase"/>
<tei:milestone unit="verse"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
